	BtnHelp: ? Help
	HelpHint: Scroll with the wheel; this help has no pages
	HelpBody:
		'''
		[Search]
		Tab opens the item browser / O network overview / P the bound terminal
		Chinese / English / full pinyin / initials all work
		@modname = only items from that mod
		Left/Right/Home/End move the caret, Delete removes one, Ctrl+A selects all
		Ctrl+V pastes / Ctrl+Z clears / Ctrl+C copies

		[Browse]
		Left-click = sources (R)   Right-click = uses (U)
		Arrow keys pick a slot, Enter opens it
		The wheel scrolls (down = further along); PageUp / PageDown jump a screen
		Star = favorites only (Ctrl + Left-click toggles)
		Sort button: default / tier / name / recent

		[Windows]
		Press and drag any empty spot in the window to move it
		Resize only with the bottom-right grip; other edges move. Reset restores the layout
		Close only closes the top window; the ones below stay open
		A subpage opens beside the main window instead of covering it

		[Cheat wrench]
		The wrench at the bottom-right turns red = cheat mode
		With it on, Shift + Left-click spawns a stack of that item
		The button is hidden when "cheat mode" is disabled in the config

		[Quick move] (terminal and content windows)
		Shift + Left-click  grid = take a full stack, inventory slot = deposit it
		Alt + Left-click    grid = take half a stack
		Ctrl + Left-click   grid = add to the multi-selection, then "Take selected"
		M = toggle the personal drop magnet (the config has its own switch)

		[Network]
		Keep stocked auto-refills when the count drops (slots show a cyan badge)
		Drives, storage units and storage buses all support partition lists
		The network overview renames networks, shows composition and usage, keeps an access log
		'''
	LblIme: IME
	ImeOn: on
	ImeOff: off
	ImeGot: "{0} chars"
	BtnClean: Clear
	ConfirmClearQueue: Click again to confirm clearing the queue
	ConfirmClearList: Click again to confirm clearing the list
	ConfirmTakeAll: Click again to take everything
	ConfirmClearTarget: Click again to confirm clearing the target
	LblRecipeMats: -- Ingredients --
	LblNeedStation: Station
	LblNoStation: none (hand craft)
	LblCraftSteps: -- Crafting Steps
	LblReady: Ready to craft
	LblMissing: -- Missing --
	LblSources: -- Sources --
	LblUses: -- Uses --
	LblTreasureBag: -- Treasure Bag / Crate Contents --
	LblSpawnCondition: Spawn Conditions
	LblShop: -- Sold By --
	LblShimmer: -- Shimmer --
	LblSummon: -- Summons --
	LblNoSources: No known source
	LblNoUses: No known use
	LblDropRate: drop rate
	LblBuyPrice: price
	LblNoItemSelected: No item selected
	LblSourcesShort: "[Sources] "
	LblUsesShort: "[Uses] "
	LblSourceEntry: Non-crafting source
	LblUseEntry: Other uses
	LblRecipeFailed: Failed to read the recipe
	LblRecipeConsumes: This recipe consumes it
	LblRecipeMakes: This recipe makes it
	LblHandCraft: Hand craft
	LblOutput: Output
	LblMoreEntries: ... {0} more
	HintNoUses: It may be a material / decoration, or used by another mod's mechanics
	HintNoSources: Obtainable only from monster drops / shops / shimmer / treasure bags
	HintClickIngredient: (click an ingredient to jump to it)
}
